### Base URL pentru user-microservice
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/spring-demo

### 1. Inserare Utilizator Nou (POST /person)
POST {{baseUrl}}/person
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Popescu Ion",
  "address": "Strada Memorandumului 28, Cluj-Napoca",
  "age": 25
}

> {%
    client.global.set("generatedUserId", response.body);
%}

### 2. Preluare Toti Utilizatorii (GET /person)
GET {{baseUrl}}/person
Accept: application/json

### 3. Preluare Utilizator dupa ID (GET /person/{id})
# Foloseste automat ID-ul generat la Pasul 1 daca rulati in IntelliJ
GET {{baseUrl}}/person/{{generatedUserId}}
Accept: application/json

### 4. Actualizare Utilizator (PUT /person/{id})
PUT {{baseUrl}}/person/{{generatedUserId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Popescu Ion Actualizat",
  "address": "Strada Observatorului 34, Cluj-Napoca",
  "age": 26
}

### 5. Stergere Utilizator dupa ID (DELETE /person/{id})
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/person/{{generatedUserId}}
